Description: Implements Full Prognostic Score methods for causal effect
    estimation using parametric and machine-learning approaches. The package
    provides regression imputation, matching, stratification, inverse
    probability weighting, normalized inverse probability weighting, and
    augmented inverse probability weighting estimators for continuous and
    binary outcomes.

